{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e4c084b5-ec11-865c-9d76-0e3f217bb665",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T09:44:19-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Teresa Souza",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:37:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:38:04-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Denise, and thank you for taking my call. My name is Teresa Souza. I'm calling about the water at the bottom of my driveway, thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:38:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Ms. Souza. What's going on with the driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:38:23-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, since last weekend's storm, the snow that turned to rain, Sunday into Monday, there is a puddle sitting right at the apron of the driveway. Thank you for listening. It does not go down the street. It runs back toward the garage door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:38:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Toward the garage, not away from it. Okay. And what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:38:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 225 Gibbs Avenue, on the Ocean Drive side. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:38:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 225 Gibbs. How deep is the water right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:39:04-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, it is about up to the hubcaps. On my car, I mean. I measured it by the car, thank you. That is deep enough that I cannot take the car out without getting soaked to the knees."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:39:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wow, that's a lot. Is it still there today, a day after the rain stopped?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:39:31-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is still there. It was there Monday and it is there this morning. [pause] Excuse me, one moment, I am loading the dishwasher, so you may hear the plates. I do apologize."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:39:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, go right ahead. I hear them, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:39:54-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. So, as I was saying, it keeps happening. Every time we get a hard rain, or the snow melts, the water collects there and nobody comes. I have been patient, thank you, but it is not right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:40:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Is there a storm drain close by, that you can see? Is it covered with snow or leaves or slush?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:40:25-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a grate down the road a little way. I believe it is clogged with leaves and ice, but I do not like to walk out there. The road is slippery, thank you for asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:40:43-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood, don't go out on that. I'll put in a work order so a crew can check the drain and the low spot out front. They're pretty busy after a storm like this one, so I can't tell you exactly what time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:41:04-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand they are busy, and thank you. But I would like it noted that this is not the first time. I have called before about water in that spot, and it seems that nothing is ever done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:41:23-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll note that it's a recurring problem there. That helps the crew know it's not a one-time thing. Is the water getting into the garage at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:41:37-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not yet, thank you. It comes to the door and stops. But if it rises any more, I do not know. [pause] Excuse me, the dishes again. I will be quick."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:41:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time, Ms. Souza."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:41:56-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Denise. You are very kind. I just want somebody to come and look at it, because I am seventy-some years old and I cannot be shoveling and bailing a driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:42:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you shouldn't have to. Let me get your phone number so we can follow up with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:42:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is 401-555-0153. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:42:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0153. Is that your landline?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:42:28-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is, and that is the best way to reach me. If I do not answer, please let it ring, because I am sometimes in the back of the house. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:42:45-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. So I have 225 Gibbs Avenue, water pooling at the bottom of the driveway, draining toward the garage, about hubcap deep, still there from the weekend storm. I'm sending that to the crew supervisor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:43:03-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is exactly right, thank you. And would you please call me back when it is done? I would like to know that someone has actually been out. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:43:18-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll make a note to call you back once the crew has been out or the work is closed. It may take a day or two, maybe more."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:43:33-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A day or two I can manage, thank you. More than that and I will be calling again, and I hope you will forgive me for that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:43:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Call as often as you need to, and ask for me if you like. Anything else going on over there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:43:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you very much for your help, Denise, and thank you for your patience with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:44:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Souza. Stay out of that water, and have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T09:44:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You as well. Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
